<Aside title="Agents and workflows run today — as runtime objects" data-variant="not">

Skald executes agents and workflows at runtime over registered Prompts (see
[Build an agent](/how-to/build-an-agent/)). The `Agent` and `Workflow` **card
kinds** — declaring one as a registered, versioned card — are spec-only for now.

</Aside>

